      "p0002-n0002-l0005"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "As contracted by the police, our task was to make a model to help apprehend criminals and prevent future o\ufb00enses by predicting their locations and the locations of such o\ufb00enses. We chose to generate probability plots to help assist the police in assessing which areas are of higher priority for searching and monitoring. We assume we are given crime site locations and times for past o\ufb00enses of the criminal whom we are considering."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000008",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
