    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "To test our model with realistic data, we complied several case studies. We asess the quality of our predictions using multiple metrics: error distance and search cost. In the case of Peter Sutcli\ufb00e, our model was able to reduce the search area to 15% of its original size, and predicted the position of his next victim with very high accuracy. We produce color-gradient plots of the probability distributions which we present in the paper."
  }
